"jetpack (hop + fly)":"噴射背包（跳躍 + 飛行）",
"strike":"砲擊",
"quick unit switch, staying in battle (Shift — back)":"快速切換士兵，不離開戰鬥（Shift — 返回）",
"drop pod to the objective (Shift — into the fight)":"用空降艙投送到目標（Shift — 直入戰場）",
"strategy (the same key there possesses the selection)":"戰略（同一個按鍵在那裡是附身到選取的單位）",
"» STRATEGIST ROUTE · SPRINT »":"» 戰略官路線 · 衝刺 »",
"Jets II ✓":"噴射背包 II ✓",
"jets I":"噴射背包 I",
"STRATEGIST":"戰略官",
"jetpack recharging…":"噴射背包充能中…",
"Strike":"砲擊",
"Squads jet up through the dome portal and land at the enemy.":"小隊用噴射背包升空，穿過穹頂傳送門，降落在敵方陣地。",
"Elite squad with strong jetpacks — can sky-assault through the dome.":"配備強力噴射背包的精英小隊 — 可穿過穹頂空降突襲。",
"A lone railgun sniper.":"單人電磁砲狙擊手。",
"Jetpacks II: infantry reaches the dome and can sky-assault.":"噴射背包 II：步兵可飛抵穹頂並進行空降突襲。",
"Speed up: capture points (+{0}/s each) or blow up wreckage — it holds ore.":"加速：拿下佔領點（每個 +{0}/s）或炸毀殘骸 — 裡面有礦石。",
"Needs {0} CP ({1})":"需要 {0} 指揮點（現有 {1}）",
"CP come from: +1 per captured point, +1 every 75 s (next in {0}), a little for kills.":"指揮點來源：每佔領一個點 +1，每 75 秒 +1（下次在 {0} 後），擊殺敵人也會少量獲得。",
"Needs Sky troopers or the \"Jetpacks II\" research":"需要「空降兵」或「噴射背包 II」研究",
"queued #{0}":"佇列 #{0}",
"Researched: {0}{1}":"已研究：{0}{1}",
"Jetpack (hop + fly)":"噴射背包（跳躍＋飛行）",
"Tank / turret / exit":"坦克／砲塔／離開",
"Strategy: smooth wheel zoom, unit icons and labels (Alt — all), Troops / Buildings panel on the left":"戰略：滑鼠滾輪平滑縮放，單位上方顯示圖示與標籤（Alt — 顯示全部），左側為「部隊 / 建築」面板",
"RMB — attack-move, double RMB — march firing on the move; rare orders in \"More orders ▾\"; no duplicate buttons":"右鍵 — 攻擊移動，連點右鍵 — 邊走邊開火行軍；少用的命令放在「更多命令 ▾」；按鈕不重複",
"Shooter-grade guns: hitscan bullets, 720 RPM rifle, MG, recoil, RMB aim, magazines and R reload, hit markers":"射擊手感比照射擊遊戲：即時命中的子彈、每分鐘 720 發的步槍、機槍、後座力、右鍵瞄準、彈匣與 R 換彈、命中標記",
"Heavier gravity, responsive jetpack, dash on Z or double jet in the air; the weapon no longer flies along when switching units":"重力更強、噴射背包更靈敏，Z 或在空中連按兩次噴射背包可衝刺；切換單位時武器不再跟著飛走",
"Builders: select a builder, pick a building, place a blueprint; extractors on ore veins; click \"ORE\" to see income and how to boost it":"工程兵：選取工程兵，挑選建築，放置藍圖；採礦機建在礦脈上；點擊「礦石」查看收入來源與加速方法",
"Grey buttons explain why and offer a fix; bigger buttons, \"In progress\" strip, \"▶ Possess\", Tab is the one mode key":"灰色按鈕也能點，會告訴你原因並提供解決按鈕；按鈕更大、「進行中」欄、「▶ 附身」，Tab 是唯一的模式切換鍵",
"Strategy camera without jumps or flips, zoom to cursor, draggable minimap":"戰略視角不再跳動或翻轉，縮放以游標為中心，小地圖可拖曳",
"New vehicles: Jackal raider, Grad MLRS (homing rockets), Hammer mortar; the Swarm gets Wasp, Hive, Trebuchet":"新載具：「豺狼」突襲車、「冰雹」多管火箭砲（追蹤火箭彈）、「重錘」迫擊砲；蜂群新增「黃蜂」、「蜂巢」、「投石機」",
"The strategist keeps orders and stops voice spam; fights come to you; B — redeploy, Shift+B — into the fight; compass, H — which target":"AI 戰略官不再亂改命令也不再語音洗版；戰鬥會在你附近展開；B — 空降調度，Shift+B — 投入戰場；羅盤，H — 切換目標",
"Free play (K) and going solo (J), F2 presets; Esc pauses and resumes; saves: slots, export and import":"自由行動（K）與單獨行動（J），F2 預設組合；Esc 暫停並可返回；存檔：欄位、匯出與匯入檔案",
"Flight: stronger gravity far from the meteor, C in the air brakes, thrust steers sharper; no more getting stuck in the portal":"飛行：遠離隕石時重力更強，在空中按 C 煞車，推力轉向更敏銳；不再卡在傳送門裡",
"Endless war by default and battle scale: normal, large, epic":"預設為無盡戰鬥，並可選擇戰鬥規模：一般、大型、史詩",
"Save and load the battle (autosave every 3 minutes)":"可儲存與讀取戰鬥（每 3 分鐘自動存檔）",
"Squadmates with callsigns: portraits, health and live chatter":"有呼號的小隊成員：頭像、血量與即時對話",
"Fog of war in strategy, friends and foes outlined differently":"戰略中的戰爭迷霧，敵我以不同顏色標示",
"Camera fly-over when switching, portal aurora instead of rings":"切換時鏡頭飛越，傳送門極光取代光環",
"Hints (pop-ups and curator)":"提示（彈出提示與嚮導）",
"Mouse: LMB — fire, RMB — aim, Shift — jetpack. Tank: LMB — cannon, RMB — MG. M — sound, O — quality, Esc — menu.":"滑鼠：左鍵 — 開火，右鍵 — 瞄準，Shift — 噴射背包。坦克：左鍵 — 主砲，右鍵 — 機槍。M — 音效，O — 品質，Esc — 選單。",
"Test: press keys and mouse buttons":"測試：按下按鍵與滑鼠按鈕",
"Battle saved: ":"戰鬥已儲存：",
"Redeploy: pod to objective / into the fight":"調度：空降艙前往目標 / 投入戰場",
"Intel: a Swarm squad is heading your way — {0}, about {1} meters.":"偵察情報：一支蜂群小隊正朝你們而來 — {0}，約 {1} 公尺。",
"Contact from above! A Swarm pod is coming down {0}, {1} meters!":"空中接觸！蜂群空降艙正在降落於 {0}，距離 {1} 公尺！",
"Swarm signaller {0}! It will call a drop in 12 seconds — kill it first!":"蜂群信號兵出現在 {0}！12 秒後會呼叫空降 — 先幹掉它！",
"The signaller got it off! Swarm pod inbound.":"信號兵成功發出呼叫！蜂群空降艙即將抵達。",
"The Swarm is counter-attacking {0}! Get ready to defend.":"蜂群正在反攻 {0}！準備防守。",
"{0}: on our way to you, commander!":"{0}：正在趕往你的位置，指揮官！",
"Mode: going solo":"模式：單獨行動",
"Mode: squad with me":"模式：小隊跟隨",
