"Fast buggy: a 4-rocket salvo and an MG. Hunts builders and harvesters, flanks. Fragile.":"高速越野車：4 枚火箭齊射加機槍。獵殺工程兵與採礦機，迂迴側翼。脆弱。",
"Tracked mortar: a heavy shell lobbed over cover, bane of infantry. 30 m dead zone, needs spotting.":"履帶迫擊砲：重型砲彈越過掩體拋射，步兵剋星。30 公尺死區，需要觀測。",
"Salvo of 3 loosely homing rockets out to 160 m. 35 m dead zone, long reload.":"齊射 3 枚略帶追蹤的火箭彈，射程 160 公尺。35 公尺死區，裝填很久。",
